Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:17:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(0.5): hide Tutorial on the product menu, restart
 campaign at level 1

Tutorial entry (owner decision, 2026-10-19): campaign levels 1-10 ARE the
tutorial, so #menu-tutorial is hidden on the product channel. Hidden, never
deleted: the mode, its markup, its bind and its suites stay for other builds.

Campaign storage (owner decision, 2026-10-19): bump the progress and match
keys from .v1 to .v2. The bump retires existing records permanently instead
of migrating them, so every player starts over at level 1 and an old
unfinished match cannot be resumed. parseProgress tolerance is unchanged.

Update the admin reset suffixes, screenshot scripts, docs and callsites that
pinned the old key. Tests pin the hidden entry, the retired v1 record and
the .v2 round trip.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
